# Hallow's Eve pack - item names and descriptions. The game prepends the file name, so each key
# loads as items.<key>, the key an item's TranslationProperties names (items.Hallows_Eve_Jack_Lantern.name).
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Common.name = Lantern Bomb
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Common.description = A carved pumpkin packed with Boom Powder. Throw it at whatever is coming for you.
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Uncommon.name = Burning Lantern Bomb
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Uncommon.description = Essence of Fire in the powder, so whatever the blast catches keeps burning a while.
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Rare.name = Spectral Lantern Bomb
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Rare.description = Ectoplasm in the powder. The blast burns, and the chill it leaves slows anything caught in it.
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Epic.name = Shattering Lantern Bomb
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Epic.description = Packed around a Cursed Geode. It burns and chills like the others, then throws flaming shards in every direction.
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Helm.name = Jack Helm
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Helm.description = A pumpkin rind hollowed out to fit a head, with a candle behind the grin. Part of the Hallowed set: wear it with the Jack Shield in your off hand.
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Helm.description_hallowed_set = A pumpkin rind hollowed out to fit a head, with a candle behind the grin. Part of the Hallowed set: wear it with the Jack Shield in your off hand, and add the Horseman's breastplate, gauntlets and greaves for more.
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Shield.name = Jack Shield
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Shield.description = A wooden shield faced with a carved pumpkin that never stops glowing. Part of the Hallowed set: carry it in your off hand while you wear the Jack Helm.
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Shield.description_hallowed_set = A wooden shield faced with a carved pumpkin that never stops glowing. Part of the Hallowed set: carry it in your off hand while you wear the Jack Helm, and add the Horseman's breastplate, gauntlets and greaves for more.
Hallows_Eve_Burning_Jack_Helm.name = Burning Jack Helm
Hallows_Eve_Burning_Jack_Helm.description = A Jack Helm charred black, with embers still glowing in the cracks. It takes a hit better than the plain one, and fire bites less. Part of the Hallowed set: wear it with a Jack Shield or a Flaming Jack Shield in your off hand.
Hallows_Eve_Burning_Jack_Helm.description_flaming_set = A Jack Helm charred black, with embers still glowing in the cracks. It takes a hit better than the plain one, and fire bites less. Part of the Hallowed set: wear it with a Jack Shield or a Flaming Jack Shield in your off hand. With the Horseman's flaming armour and a Flaming Jack Shield, it also makes the Flaming Hallowed set.
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Jack_Shield.name = Flaming Jack Shield
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Jack_Shield.description = A Jack Shield charred black, its carved face burning like a coal. It holds a guard for less stamina than the plain one. Part of the Hallowed set: carry it in your off hand while you wear a Jack Helm or a Burning Jack Helm.
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Jack_Shield.description_flaming_set = A Jack Shield charred black, its carved face burning like a coal. It holds a guard for less stamina than the plain one. Part of the Hallowed set: carry it in your off hand while you wear a Jack Helm or a Burning Jack Helm. With a Burning Jack Helm and the Horseman's flaming armour, it also makes the Flaming Hallowed set.
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Lantern.name = Jack Lantern
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Lantern.description = A carved pumpkin with a candle inside. Old Jack wants one on every doorstep.
Hallows_Eve_Hollow_Lantern.name = Hollow Lantern
Hallows_Eve_Hollow_Lantern.description = A pale lantern Old Jack gives to whoever sees his errands through. Each Hallow's Eve has its own.
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Ember.name = The Horseman's Ember
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Ember.description = A coal from the Headless Horseman's own fire, and it never cools. Old Jack wants it for your Hollow Lantern.
Hallows_Eve_Grave_Candle.name = Grave Candle
Hallows_Eve_Grave_Candle.description = A black candle the Gravekeeper burns to open the gate to the Headless Horseman's graveyard, and the gate stays open for your whole party. Old Jack sells them at his shop, and the Horseman's Hoard gives some back.
Hallows_Eve_Burning_Grave_Candle.name = Burning Grave Candle
Hallows_Eve_Burning_Grave_Candle.description = Black candles that never stop burning. The Gravekeeper burns one to open the gate for the Headless Horseman's hard ride, and the gate stays open for your whole party. Old Jack sells them at his shop once he counts you a Regular, and trades one for a handful of Grave Candles.
Hallows_Eve_Fire_Resistance_Potion.name = Fire Resistance Potion
Hallows_Eve_Fire_Resistance_Potion.description = Drink it and fire does you half the harm for three minutes. Old Jack sells them at his shop for anyone going after the Headless Horseman.
Hallows_Eve_Eternal_Candle.name = Eternal Candle
Hallows_Eve_Eternal_Candle.description = A candle that never burns down. Carry it and the Gravekeeper opens the Headless Horseman's graveyard for your whole party without burning a Grave Candle, and you keep it. The hard ride still takes a Burning Grave Candle. Old Jack buys a spare one at his shop.
Hallows_Eve_Ecto_Lantern.name = Ecto Lantern
Hallows_Eve_Ecto_Lantern.description = A pumpkin lit by Ectoplasm. The green light holds steady in any wind.
Hallows_Eve_Costume_Wand.name = Costume Wand
Hallows_Eve_Costume_Wand.description = Point it at a friend. One button turns them into a Jack Skeleton, the other into a Lost Soul, and they can take the costume off whenever they like.
Hallows_Eve_Cursed_Geode.name = Cursed Geode
Hallows_Eve_Cursed_Geode.description = A lump of stone with something bright moving inside. During Hallow's Eve they turn up in broken stone, ore most of all. Hold it and right-click to crack it open, and keep whatever falls out.
Hallows_Eve_Ectoplasm.name = Ectoplasm
Hallows_Eve_Ectoplasm.description = What a Lost Soul leaves behind. It is cold to the touch, and carvers burn it in lanterns.
Hallows_Eve_Hallowed_Pumpkin.name = Hallowed Pumpkin
Hallows_Eve_Hallowed_Pumpkin.description = A violet pumpkin with gold in its ribs. During Hallow's Eve, one turns up now and then when you pick pumpkins by hand, and Jack Skeletons drop them. Old Jack wants them for his lanterns.
Hallows_Eve_Carving_Bench.name = Carving Bench
Hallows_Eve_Carving_Bench.description = A workbench set up for pumpkin carving. Stand at it with the makings in your bag and carve.
Hallows_Eve_Carving_Bench.hint = Press [{key}] to carve
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Breastplate.name = Horseman's Breastplate
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Breastplate.description = Ancient steel the Headless Horseman rode in, still warm from his fire. Anything you set alight burns hotter while you wear it. Part of the Hallowed set, with a Jack Helm, the rest of his armour and a Jack Shield in your off hand. Found now and then in his daily Claim.
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Gauntlets.name = Horseman's Gauntlets
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Gauntlets.description = The gloves that carried the Horseman's lantern. Anything you set alight burns hotter while you wear them. Part of the Hallowed set, with a Jack Helm, the rest of his armour and a Jack Shield in your off hand. Found now and then in his daily Claim.
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Greaves.name = Horseman's Greaves
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Greaves.description = Ancient steel from the Horseman's saddle, scorched black at the knees. Anything you set alight burns hotter while you wear them. Part of the Hallowed set, with a Jack Helm, the rest of his armour and a Jack Shield in your off hand. Found now and then in his daily Claim.
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Breastplate.name = Flaming Horseman's Breastplate
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Breastplate.description = The Horseman's breastplate, with his fire still burning in it. Fire bites less while you wear it, and anything you set alight burns hotter. Part of the Hallowed set, and of the Flaming Hallowed set with a Burning Jack Helm, the rest of his flaming armour and a Flaming Jack Shield in your off hand. Found only in the Horseman's Hoard on the hard ride.
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Gauntlets.name = Flaming Horseman's Gauntlets
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Gauntlets.description = The gloves that carried the Horseman's lantern, still burning at the fingers. Fire bites less while you wear them, and anything you set alight burns hotter. Part of the Hallowed set, and of the Flaming Hallowed set with a Burning Jack Helm, the rest of his flaming armour and a Flaming Jack Shield in your off hand. Found now and then in the Horseman's Hoard.
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Greaves.name = Flaming Horseman's Greaves
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Greaves.description = Ancient steel from the Horseman's saddle, still burning at the knees. Fire bites less while you wear them, and anything you set alight burns hotter. Part of the Hallowed set, and of the Flaming Hallowed set with a Burning Jack Helm, the rest of his flaming armour and a Flaming Jack Shield in your off hand. Found now and then in the Horseman's Hoard.
